# FILE DOCUMENTATION
# Where: .gitignore at the repository root, applied by Git to the whole solution.
# What: The patterns below exclude IDE state, compiler output, test results, user-local settings, and transient logs.
# Why: These files are reproducible or machine-specific, so committing them would create noise and merge conflicts.

.vs/
bin/
obj/
TestResults/
*.user
*.suo
haven-build.log
